    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abarira Aroni ati: “Wewe n’abahungu bawe n’abo mu nzu ya so ni mwebwe muzobazwa ibicumuro vyose bizokorerwa mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro, kandi wewe n’abahungu bawe ni mwebwe mwenyene muzobazwa ibicumuro vyose bizokorwa ku bijanye n’ubuherezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uze uzane Abalewi bagenzawe bagufashe mu gihe wewe n’abahungu bawe muriko murakora igikorwa canyu imbere y’ihema ry’ibishinga intahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baze bagukorere bakore ibikorwa vy’ihema, ariko ntibaze begere ibikoresho vyera canke igicaniro, kugira ngo ntihagire uwupfa, yaba wewe canke bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazoba abo kugufasha mu gutunganya ivy’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro, ibikorwa vyose bijanye na ryo; kandi nta wundi yemerewe kwegera aho uri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwebwe muzobazwa ivyo gutunganya ivy’ahera n’igicaniro, kugira ngo ishavu ryanje ntiryongere kuziriringa ku Bisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni jewe ubwanje narobanuye bagenzi banyu b’Abalewi ndabakuye mu bandi Bisirayeli nk’ingabire ndabahaye, yeguriwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kugira ngo bakore ibikorwa vyo mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko wewe wenyene n’abahungu bawe ni mwebwe muzokora igikorwa c’ubuherezi hamwe n’ibintu vyose bijanye n’igicaniro no hirya ya ca gihuzu gikingiriye ahera. Nabahaye igikorwa c’ubuherezi nk’ingabire. Uwundi muntu wese azokwegera ahera aze yicwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abarira Aroni ati: “Ni jewe ubwanje nakujeje ibimazi vyose banshikanira; ibimazi vyose vyera Abisirayeli banshikanira ndabiguhaye wewe n’abahungu bawe nk’umugabane wawe w’ibihe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muze mwakire umugabane ku bimazi birusha ibindi kwera vyasigaye ku vyo baturiye. Ku mashikanwa banzanira nk’ibimazi bisumba ibindi kwera, ari ivyo ifu canke ibimazi vy’ivyaha canke vyo kwisaba, uwo mugabane uzoba ari uwawe n’abahungu bawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muze mubirye muzi ko ari ivyera birusha ibindi; abagabo n’abahungu bonyene ni bo bemerewe kubiryako. Muze mubifate nk’ivyera nyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’ibi na vyo ni ivyanyu: ibizova ku mashikanwa yo kuzungagiza atangwa n’Abisirayeli, ndabiguhaye wewe n’abahungu bawe n’abakobwa bawe nk’umugabane wanyu ibihe vyose. Umuntu wese aba mu nzu yanyu adahumanye yemerewe kubiryako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndabahaye n’amavuta ya Elayo yose n’umuvinyu mushasha wose n’ingano banshikanira nk’ivyeze imbere y’ibindi mu vyimburwa vyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyeze imbere y’ibindi mu gihugu banshikanira jewe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " bizoba ari ivyanyu. Umuntu wese adahumanye aba mu nzu iwawe yemerewe kubiryako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo Abisirayeli bagereye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " vyose ni ivyanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icavutse ubwambere cose, ari umuntu canke igitungano, bihawe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " vyose ni ivyanyu. Ariko muze mucungure imfura zanyu z’abahungu n’ivy’uburiza vy’ibikoko bizira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu gihe bimaze ukwezi, muze mubicungure murihe ikiguzi co kubicungura kingana na shekeli zitanu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’amagarama 58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’ifeza, zipimwe hakoreshejwe ingero shekeli y’Ahera, ipima gera mirongo ibiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ntimuze mucungure iriza ry’ishuri, intama canke impene; bizoba ari ivyera. Muze mumijagire amaraso yavyo ku gicaniro muturire n’ibinure vyavyo nk’ikimazi co guturirwa, ubumote bwiza bunezera ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyama zavyo zizoba ari izanyu, hamwe n’igikiriza c’ishikanwa ryo kuzugunzwa n’itako ry’i buryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndabahaye ivyo Abisirayeli bazanye nk’amashikanwa yera; bizoba ari umugabane wanyu ibihe vyose wewe n’abahungu bawe n’abakobwa bawe, nk’uko isezerano ry’intahava nasezeranye nawe n’uruvyaro rwawe riri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
