          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwira Abalewi uti: ‘Nimwashikana uwo mugabane uruta iyindi, uzoba ari nk’icavuye mu vyo mwimbuye ku mbuga no mu bwato muganiramwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwebwe n’abo mu mazu iwanyu muze murire ibisigaye aho ari ho hose kuko ari impembo yanyu kubera igikorwa canyu mukora mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwashikana wa mugabane uruta iyindi ntimuzoba mucumuye kuri ico; aho rero ntimuzohumanya amashikanwa yera y’Abisirayeli, ngo bibazanire gupfa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
